	"finalDifficulty": 0,
	"shortDescription": "We've had confirmation from several sources that a high ranking {TEAM_TAR.FactionDef.ShortName} officer is moving in the open.  This is a rare opportunity to disrupt their command structure on {TGT_SYSTEM.name}.  We'll pay a 33% bonus per lance if you can also destroy his personal guard and any other {TEAM_TAR.FactionDef.Demonym} forces in the AO.",
	"longDescription": "I've negotiated a major bump if we DO end up finding the propagandist and eliminating her, as well as a danger-pay bonus if she has any escorts and we eliminate them as well.",
